  m_Name: Ending_OtherPanda
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Ending
  endingTitle: Panda
  titleDA: Sammen
  descriptionDA: "De to pandaer er sammen! \n\nDer er ikke meget bambus tilbage,
    s\xE5 de bliver m\xE5ske n\xF8dt til at skilles snart. \n\nK\xE6mpepandaer lever
    som regel alene og m\xF8des kun om for\xE5ret for at f\xE5 unger. \n\nDet er
    vigtigt at holde skovene forbundet, s\xE5 pandaerne kan finde hinanden og parre
    sig!\n\nN\xE5r du bes\xF8ger zoologisk have, st\xF8tter du et avlsprogram, der
    er med til at beskytte k\xE6mpepandaer! \nOg n\xE5r du k\xF8ber bambusprodukter,
    s\xE5 kig efter FSC-m\xE6rket. Det hj\xE6lper dig med at v\xE6lge produkter,
    der er lavet med omtanke for skovene og dyrelivet.  "
  titleEN: "Staying Together\_"
  descriptionEN: "The two pandas are together! \n\nThere's not much bamboo left,
    so they may have to separate soon. \n\nGiant pandas usually live alone and only
    meet in spring to have cubs. \n\nIt's important to keep forests connected so
    pandas can find each other and have babies! \n\nWhen you visit the zoo, you support
    a breeding program that helps protect giant pandas! \nAnd when you buy bamboo
    products, look for the FSC label. It helps you choose products made with care
    for forests and wildlife.  "
  endingImage: {fileID: 0}
